sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If two numbers have to one another the ratio which a cubic number has to a cubic number, and the first is a cube, then the second is also a cube.
----
proof:

Let the two numbers {A} and {B} have to one another the ratio which the cubic number {C} has to the cubic number {D}, and let {A} be a cube.

